### 5. OpenRouter Model Strategy (your request #1)

**Recommended mapping (configurable in `lib/ai/models.ts`):**

| Stage                       | Recommended Model (OpenRouter ID)     | Reason                             | Fallback       |
| --------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- | -------------- |
| Interview dynamic questions | anthropic/claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022  | Best reasoning & conversation      | claude-3-haiku |
| Project + Goals (Hit 1)     | anthropic/claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022  | Creative + structured writing      | gpt-4o         |
| Design Guidelines (Hit 2)   | anthropic/claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022  | Excellent at visual/language specs | gemini-flash   |
| Tech Stack (Hit 3)          | deepseek/deepseek-r1 or openai/gpt-4o | Strong coding knowledge            | grok-beta      |
| Task List + Prompts         | anthropic/claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022  | Best at breaking down work         | gpt-4o         |

- Store model choices in a simple config object so you can A/B test later.
- Add cost tracking per project.

