### 6. Technical Architecture (Bun + Nuxt 4)

- **Backend:** Bun with Elysia under /backend
- **Framework:** Nuxt 4 under /frontend
- **Database:** Drizzle ORM + Postrgres
- **Auth:** BetterAuth.
- **UI:** Tailwind + Vueshadcn
- **AI Layer:** Server-only API routes that call OpenRouter (never expose API key)

