### 7. Non-Functional Requirements

- All AI calls must be streamed where possible (great UX)
- Rate-limit & cost guardrails (show estimated cost before big generations)
- Fully responsive (mobile-friendly interview)
- Dark mode by default (vibe coders love it)
- Export everything as markdown + JSON at any time

